  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "MEMORY_START",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你在修炼时突然看到一段模糊的画面：\n数十名修士在飞升台前战斗，天空中降下雷霆...\n\n这段记忆碎片似乎在引导你去某个地方。",
      "next_node": "MEMORY_CHOICE"
    },
    {
      "id": "MEMORY_CHOICE",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "记忆碎片在你的意识中回荡，你需要做出回应。",
      "choices": [
        {
          "id": "follow",
          "text": "跟随记忆碎片的指引",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "quest_trigger",
              "target": "memory_fragment_002",
              "value": true
            },
            {
              "type": "dao_heart_change",
              "value": 5
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "MEMORY_FOLLOW"
        },
        {
          "id": "resist",
          "text": "集中精神，抵抗这段记忆",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "skill_check",
              "target": "willpower",
              "operator": ">=",
              "value": 15
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "MEMORY_RESIST_CHECK"
        },
        {
          "id": "record",
          "text": "记录下记忆细节，找云中鹤分析",
          "effects": [
            {
              "type": "relationship_change",
              "target": "yunzhonghe",
              "value": 5
            },
            {
              "type": "item_give",
              "target": "memory_notes",
              "value": 1
            }
          ],
          "next_node": "MEMORY_RECORD"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MEMORY_FOLLOW",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你放任记忆碎片引导你的意识...\n\n一幅更清晰的画面展开：你看到了封印阵法的细节，\n以及那个主持仪式的黑衣人的轮廓。\n\n[b]解锁任务：[/b]记忆碎片·第二片\n[b]推进主线：[/b]飞升之谜\n[b]道心：[/b]+5",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "dao_heart_change",
          "value": 5
        },
        {
          "type": "quest_trigger",
          "target": "memory_fragment_002"
        },
        {
          "type": "give_exp",
          "value": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "ancient_technique_scroll",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MEMORY_RESIST_CHECK",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你紧闭双眼，集中全部精神抵抗记忆的入侵。",
      "next_node": "MEMORY_RESIST_RESULT"
    },
    {
      "id": "MEMORY_RESIST_RESULT",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "[b]意志坚定：[/b]你成功压制了记忆碎片，\n但灵气因此波动，修为略有增长。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]灵气+10",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "give_exp",
          "value": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "MEMORY_RECORD",
      "speaker": "system",
      "text": "你迅速将记忆细节记录在玉简上，返回青云镇找云中鹤。\n\n云中鹤看完记录后，神色凝重：\n\"这些画面...比我想象的更详细。也许你真的与那场战争有缘。\"\n\n他提供了一些额外信息。\n\n[b]获得：[/b]记忆笔记\n[b]云中鹤关系：[/b]+5",
      "next_node": "END",
      "effects": [
        {
          "type": "item_give",
          "target": "memory_note",
          "value": 1
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
